ice name of the response.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"statusCode\":{\"description\":\"The email service specific status code and it is returned through the response body.\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"statusText\":{\"description\":\"The status text of the response.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"success\":{\"description\":\"If the response is successful or not\",\"type\":\"boolean\"}},\"title\":\"MailServiceBaseResponse\",\"type\":\"object\"},{\"properties\":{\"data\":{\"properties\":{\"account_id\":{\"description\":\"The connection account ID\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"add_time\":{\"description\":\"The insertion into the database time of the mail message\",\"format\":\"date-time\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"bcc\":{\"description\":\"The array of mail message blind copies (object)\",\"items\":{\"properties\":{\"email_address\":{\"description\":\"Mail address of the mail participant\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"id\":{\"description\":\"ID of the mail participant\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"linked_person_id\":{\"description\":\"ID of the linked person to the mail message\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"linked_person_name\":{\"description\":\"Name of the linked person to the mail message\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"mail_message_party_id\":{\"description\":\"ID of the mail message participant\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"name\":{\"description\":\"Name of the mail participant\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"body\":{\"description\":\"The mail message body content. Only present when `include_body=1` is passed.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"body_url\":{\"description\":\"The mail message body URL\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"cc\":{\"description\":\"The array of mail message copies (object)\",\"items\":{\"properties\":{\"email_address\":{\"description\":\"Mail address of the mail participant\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"id\":{\"description\":\"ID of the mail participant\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"linked_person_id\":{\"description\":\"ID of the linked person to the mail message\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"linked_person_name\":{\"description\":\"Name of the linked person to the mail message\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"mail_message_party_id\":{\"description\":\"ID of the mail message participant\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"name\":{\"description\":\"Name of the mail participant\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"deleted_flag\":{\"allOf\":[{\"default\":0,\"enum\":[0,1],\"title\":\"numberBooleanDefault0\",\"type\":\"number\"}],\"description\":\"Whether the mail message is deleted or not\"},\"draft\":{\"description\":\"If the mail message has a draft status then the value is the mail message object as JSON formatted string, otherwise `null`.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"draft_flag\":{\"allOf\":[{\"default\":0,\"enum\":[0,1],\"title\":\"numberBooleanDefault0\",\"type\":\"number\"}],\"description\":\"Whether the mail message is a draft or not\"},\"from\":{\"description\":\"The array of mail message sender (object)\",\"items\":{\"properties\":{\"email_address\":{\"description\":\"Mail address of the mail participant\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"id\":{\"description\":\"ID of the mail participant\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"linked_person_id\":{\"description\":\"ID of the linked person to the mail message\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"linked_person_name\":{\"description\":\"Name of the linked person to the mail message\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"mail_message_party_id\":{\"description\":\"ID of the mail message participant\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"name\":{\"description\":\"Name of the mail participant\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"has_attachments_flag\":{\"allOf\":[{\"default\":0,\"enum\":[0,1],\"title\":\"numberBooleanDefault0\",\"type\":\"number\"}],\"description\":\"Whether the mail message has an attachment or not\"},\"has_body_flag\":{\"allOf\":[{\"default\":0,\"enum\":[0,1],\"title\":\"numberBooleanDefault0\",\"type\":\"number\"}],\"description\":\"Whether the mail message has a body or not\"},\"has_inline_attachmen